>i'm playing an old version of hack (vers 1.01) on the ibm-pc.
>I got to the last level (the maze) and I killed the minotaur and
>actually have a magic map of the level.  The dead minotaur had a wand
>of digging but I have no clue of where to dig or what to do next.
>anybody know?

Find an enormous rock in a dead end corridor.  Use the wand to dig past the
enormous rock, then push the rock into the space you just dug.  The Amulet of
Yendor will be under the enormous rock, and will be revealed after you push
the rock away.

Later versions have instead a wand of wishing, which you usually need in order
to get the equipment necessary to reach the Amulet of Yendor.
